    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booty Battler</strong>: An auto-battler pirate adventure in the pursuit of loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Captain, your role involves recruiting and managing your crew through multiple maps filled with enemies and treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain and Helmsman - You steer the ship! Progression is heavily dependent on being able to collect the loot from battle before it sinks beneath the waves! Your crew, relics and ship equipment can improve your ship's mobility, but ultimately it is up to you to prioritize and navigate to the loot necessary for your crew's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latest updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are in! These unique and powerful items will help you throughout the entire run. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 more friendly units added (90 more to go until full-release worthy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit Traits are in! Each unit has a trait, when your raiding party has at least 2 matching traits, the trait bonus is activated for powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery events are in! These can be an opportunity for extra loot, tough battles, unique pirates, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI and Graphics overhaul - New UI system with tooltips to provide clarity on your ship's status, and upgraded water and battle graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Equipment is in! -\u00a0 Slotted into slots separate from your raiding party, these cards provide your ship with various mobility options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booty Battler</strong>: An auto-battler pirate adventure in the pursuit of loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Captain, your role involves recruiting and managing your crew through multiple maps filled with enemies and treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain and Helmsman - You steer the ship! Progression is heavily dependent on being able to collect the loot from battle before it sinks beneath the waves! Your crew, relics and ship equipment can improve your ship's mobility, but ultimately it is up to you to prioritize and navigate to the loot necessary for your crew's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latest updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are in! These unique and powerful items will help you throughout the entire run. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 more friendly units added (90 more to go until full-release worthy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unit Traits are in! Each unit has a trait, when your raiding party has at least 2 matching traits, the trait bonus is activated for powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery events are in! These can be an opportunity for extra loot, tough battles, unique pirates, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI and Graphics overhaul - New UI system with tooltips to provide clarity on your ship's status, and upgraded water and battle graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship Equipment is in! -\u00a0 Slotted into slots separate from your raiding party, these cards provide your ship with various mobility options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build and manage your team of pirates to escape the PlunderDome! Fight through enemy teams of various types and difficulties, visit shops and select rewards that fit your team's needs. Never stop gathering loot!",
